Subject: LIT: extropian themes in G.B. Shaw?

          >Flamage is a waste product.  So are omphaloskeptic META:
          >posts.  Appealing to enlightened self-interest, I suggest
          >that anyone catching themselves posting either to the list
          >compensate - a forfeit, if you will - by contributing an
